{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"c delegates c delegates","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md","fileName":"C# Delegates.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"C# Delegates","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 21:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[C Sharp Interfaces Generics and Inheritance]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["C Sharp Interfaces Generics and Inheritance","hands-onobject-orientedprogrammingwithc.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"c delegates c delegates","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md","fileName":"C# Delegates.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"C# Delegates","heading":"C# Delegates","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A C# delegate is a type-safe reference to a method with a specified parameter and return signature. Code can store the delegate, pass it as data, and invoke the referenced method later without depending directly on its declaring type.\n\nSeveral compatible method references can be combined into a multicast delegate and invoked in sequence. Delegates form the basis of events and also appear as the function arguments used by LINQ operators and other callback-oriented APIs.\n\nA delegate can be assigned any compatible static or instance method, including through method-group conversion. A multicast delegate maintains an invocation list that can be extended with `+=` and reduced with `-=`, invoking registered methods in order.","tags":["baby"],"links":["C Sharp Interfaces Generics and Inheritance","hands-onobject-orientedprogrammingwithc.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"c delegates c delegates","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/C# Delegates.md","fileName":"C# Delegates.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"C# Delegates","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[hands-onobject-orientedprogrammingwithc.pdf]]\n\n[[c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["C Sharp Interfaces Generics and Inheritance","hands-onobject-orientedprogrammingwithc.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}